OL,3,GNEWSAFish firm fined #245,000 for
OL,4,Asafety breach after worker pulled into
OL,5,Amachine
OL,6,
OL,7,FA fish processing firm has been fined
OL,8,F#245,000 after a worker was dragged
OL,9,Finto a machine in Aberdeenshire.
OL,11,FThe 30-year-old man was trying to free
OL,12,Fa jammed box at Lunar Freezing and Cold
OL,13,FStorage in Peterhead when his right arm
OL,14,Fwas pulled into the mechanism.
OL,16,FHe suffered a fractured jaw and
OL,17,Finjuries to his chest and arm, and
OL,18,Fneeded surgery.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
