OL,3,GNEWSAFish firm fined #245,000 for
OL,4,Asafety breach after worker pulled into
OL,5,Amachine
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn investigation by the Health and
OL,8,FSafety Executive (HSE) into the
OL,9,Fincident in August last year found a
OL,10,Fsafety guard had been removed during
OL,11,Fmaintenance two weeks earlier and was
OL,12,Fnot replaced.
